{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Just Do Eat - Survival Project</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survive in a world of natural selection!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Eat, Escape, Evolve.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start your survival journey in a microscopic corner of the universe. Hunt creatures weaker than you while cleverly avoiding stronger ones to grow and evolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25b6 <strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Intense survival action with simple touch controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategic growth through three evolution paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your organism with unique skills and parts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Endless challenges and ranking system</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own survival strategy as you evolve towards supremacy. Can you become the ruler of this micro cosmos?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;It is not the strongest of the species that survives, nor the most intelligent. It is the one most adaptable to change.&quot;</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3477240?t=1744642556","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3477240?t=1744642556","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477240/274fb3acf955b77f5cb4d8851e18643d8893a4b0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744642556","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477240/274fb3acf955b77f5cb4d8851e18643d8893a4b0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744642556","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":